d. Preserve the test-cost priority, full functional backlog and builder-owned first-Jam readiness; run the compact complete gate once when the revised executable candidate warrants it.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:a803de1f52e7b6bfa2c3f00e96426c469c363678","binding":"assigned","head":"15680192f93b6268f405b52b21ce0874060bc193","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:d18b7812a43cf13391ef826e09b103608af0b492\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0d7ccc8f09ee153631fc7be034a329a6ff144769\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1c6bf45cec20f310b5f3e5871281ff676709814c\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0d7ccc8f09ee153631fc7be034a329a6ff144769","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}